l on v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback, and it completed in all regions.\n- **Version choice:** v2.3.0 is the most recent release that was healthy. v2.3.1 and v2.3.1-rc are both unhealthy. Because v2.3.0 has run healthy in production before, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 describes the failure, the partial rollback and retry, and the current state. The first incident request timed out, so I retried it with an idempotency key. It was opened once.\n\nFollow-up for the team: find out why v2.3.1 is failing, and why the orchestrator halted the first rollback partway through. Don't re-release v2.3.1 until that is understood.", "type": "text"}]}]}